              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho izwi lecilongo selikhala kakhulu futhi likhula kakhulu, uMose wakhuluma, futhi uNkulunkulu wamphendula ngezwi.",
          "type": "text",
