              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova wehlela phezu kwentaba yaseSinayi esiqongweni sentaba, uJehova wambiza uMose ukuba eze esiqongweni sentaba; uMose wakhuphuka.",
          "type": "text",
